    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15250" root="ردغ" body-key="r">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اردغت الأَرْضُ</span></b>  <i>The land,</i> or <i>ground, was,</i> or
<i>became, very slimy</i> or <i>miry;</i> [like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارزغت</span>;] or
<i>had much stiff slime</i> or <i>mire;</i> (K;) as also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اردعت</span>. (TA.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَدِغَ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اردغت</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">السَّمَآءُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ارزغت</span> <i>The sky gave water such as
moistened the earth</i> or <i>ground.</i> (TA.)

